# Root .gitignore for MedStock.
# Each service also ships its own .gitignore (target/, HELP.md, .idea, .vscode) and
# frontend/ has one for node_modules/dist. Those nested files only apply inside their own
# directory, so anything at the repo root - most importantly the shared .idea/ project -
# has to be listed here.

### IDE / editor ###
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr

*.iws
.vscode/
.settings/
.project
.classpath
.factorypath
.apt_generated
.springBeans
.sts4-cache

### Java / Maven build output ###
target/
build/
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

### Node / frontend build output ###
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local
.vite/

### Logs ###
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

### OS noise ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

### Local environment overrides ###
# Committed application.properties files currently hold the DB password and jwt.secret.
# They are intentionally NOT ignored, because the services will not start without them -
# but move those two values to environment variables before this repo goes public, and
# keep any local-only overrides out of git via the patterns below.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*application-local.properties
*application-secrets.properties

### Database dumps / scratch ###
*.sql.bak
*.dump
backup/
